><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 or DirectX 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":35,"final":324,"final_formatted":"$3.24 USD","initial":499,"initial_formatted":"$4.99"},"publishers":["What's All That Racket"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"18 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe writing was the highlight of Arcane Investigations for me. I frequently smiled and even chuckled out loud to myself. Presenting clues and investigating a suspect\u2019s room elicited playful conversations. The words are well augmented by well-timed music cues that got me appropriately amped, and charming artwork that makes the landscapes and characters feel alive.\u201d<br>8.9/10 \u2013 The Punished Backlog<br><br>\u201cArcane Investigations is a short burst of cozy gaming, perfect for rainy Spring days. As I said, I wouldn\u2019t mind playing more in the same world. You might agree after playing Arcane Investigations\u201d<br>Ladies Gamers<br><br>\u201c...It gave me the same chills I feel when I\u2019m playing a Phoenix Wright case for the first time \u2013 and that\u2019s a pretty impressive feat.\u201d<br>Adventure Game Hotspot<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581090/2a931d74ad830abbb53939d179c2a46adf9ef02d/ss_2a931d74ad830abbb53939d179c2a46adf9ef02d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760652344","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.stea